    """Hidden back-compat alias for the removed `eesel tools` command.

    The action surface moved under `eesel integrations <integration> actions`,
    which lists one integration at a time. This alias preserves the old
    behavior — a read-only list of an agent's actions across all integrations —
    so existing scripts that call `eesel tools [agent]` keep working.
    Defaults to the active agent; pass an id / id-prefix / name for another.
    """
    creds = require_creds()
